      "description": "Compact dark navigation with a restrained active indicator.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Voorbeeldnavigatie\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#home\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#diensten\">Diensten</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#werkwijze\">Werkwijze</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>",
