    {
      "name": "Service Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "service-card",
      "description": "A flat service container with technical icon and explicit discussion action.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-service\"><span class=\"ds-service-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 1v4m6-4v4M9 19v4m6-4v4M1 9h4m-4 6h4m14-6h4m-4 6h4M9 9h6v6H9z\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"ds-service-title\">PLC-automatisering</h3><p class=\"ds-service-copy\">Siemens PLC-programma’s op maat voor uw machine of proces, op basis van uw functionele beschrijving.</p><a class=\"ds-service-link\" href=\"#offerte\">PLC-project bespreken <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-service{padding:29px 22px 23px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dce3e9);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#111f2d);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;max-width:300px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif}.ds-service-icon{color:#086d9f;margin-bottom:26px}.ds-service-title{margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-service-copy{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted,#526272);margin:16px 0 23px}.ds-service-link{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:9px;min-height:44px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0067a8;margin-top:auto;text-decoration:none;width:100%}.ds-service-link svg{width:17px}.ds-service-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-service-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--bright,#079ef3);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Step",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Numbered technical step from the connected delivery sequence.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-step\"><span class=\"ds-step-number\">2</span><span class=\"ds-step-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 1v4m6-4v4M9 19v4m6-4v4M1 9h4m-4 6h4m14-6h4m-4 6h4M9 9h6v6H9z\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"ds-step-title\">Programmering</h3><p class=\"ds-step-copy\">We werken de afgesproken logica uit in een PLC- of LOGO!-programma.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-step{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#0a151d,#1a2c3b);color:#fff;padding:24px;max-width:240px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif}.ds-step-number{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:35px;height:35px;border:1px solid #0aabff;border-radius:50%;color:#58c6ff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:27px;background:#0d1e2b}.ds-step-icon{display:block;color:#f3f7fb;margin-bottom:21px}.ds-step-icon svg{width:30px;height:30px}.ds-step-title{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.015em;font-weight:800}.ds-step-copy{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#c6d3dd;margin:10px 0 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quote Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native disclosure with dark tonal depth and an explicit quote action.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-quote\"><summary class=\"ds-quote-summary\"><span><strong class=\"ds-quote-title\">Klaar om uw project te bespreken?</strong><span class=\"ds-quote-copy\">Vertel ons wat uw besturing moet doen.</span></span><span class=\"ds-quote-action\">Offerte aanvragen <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></summary><p class=\"ds-quote-body\">Uw bericht wordt klaargezet in uw mailprogramma of WhatsApp. Controleer het en druk daar zelf op verzenden.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-quote{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#061019,#172f43);color:#fff;border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;max-width:760px}.ds-quote-summary{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;padding:32px 37px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer}.ds-quote-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-quote-title{display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-quote-copy{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#d7e4ef;margin-top:5px}.ds-quote-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;min-height:48px;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;font:700 13px/1.4 Manrope,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s,color .18s,border-color .18s;background:var(--blue,#0077bf);color:#fff}.ds-quote-summary:hover .ds-quote-action{background:#0065a4}.ds-quote-summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--bright,#079ef3);outline-offset:5px;outline-offset:-5px}.ds-quote[open] .ds-quote-summary{border-bottom:1px solid #36556d}.ds-quote[open] .ds-quote-action svg{transform:rotate(-90deg)}.ds-quote-body{padding:24px 37px;margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#d0dce6}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quote-action{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Consent Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Floating consent treatment with refusal and permission equally available.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-consent\" aria-label=\"Privacykeuze\"><h2 class=\"ds-consent-title\">Uw privacy, uw keuze</h2><p class=\"ds-consent-copy\">Met uw toestemming gebruikt BenTech een Google Ads-tag om campagnes en websitebezoek te meten.</p><div class=\"ds-consent-actions\"><button class=\"ds-consent-reject\" type=\"button\">Alles weigeren</button><button class=\"ds-consent-accept\" type=\"button\">Marketing toestaan</button></div></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-consent{background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#111f2d);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 25px;box-shadow:0 10px 45px #001e3c38;max-width:540px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif}.ds-consent-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.ds-consent-copy{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#526272);line-height:1.8;margin:6px 0 0}.ds-consent-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.ds-consent-accept,.ds-consent-reject{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;min-height:48px;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;font:700 13px/1.4 Manrope,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s,color .18s,border-color .18s;font-size:11px;padding:12px 15px}.ds-consent-accept{background:var(--blue,#0077bf);color:#fff}.ds-consent-accept:hover{background:#0065a4}.ds-consent-reject{background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#111f2d);border-color:#9aaebb}.ds-consent-reject:hover{background:#e9f2f8}.ds-consent-accept:focus-visible,.ds-consent-reject:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--bright,#079ef3);outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-consent-accept,.ds-consent-reject{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Industrial programming made tangible",
    "overview": "The selected world puts tangible controllers and clear technical language inside an inky navy frame. Electric blue marks actions and programming emphasis; cool light sections keep service explanations easy to scan. Bold geometric Manrope and thin SVG strokes connect the photographic hardware to the interface.\n\nThe system is restrained and specific: broad tonal fields, inset content, fine borders and rounded technical containers. The current homepage expresses this world through a controller hero, services, a connected delivery sequence, illustrative applications and a quote disclosure. That page sequence belongs to its surface contract rather than becoming a mandatory template for every future page.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Navy and light surfaces alternate with a clear reading order.",
      "Electric blue identifies action, focus and technical emphasis.",
      "Self-hosted Manrope gives headings a compact, geometric voice.",
      "Controller and application rasters remain visibly illustrative.",
      "Borders and tonal layering carry depth; motion is brief."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Blue Signal Rule",
        "body": "Use blue for an action, a focus cue or a technical emphasis already represented in the system. Keep long-form copy neutral.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Legible Ground Rule",
        "body": "Put light text on dark fields and ink text on light fields. When controller imagery sits behind copy, retain enough dark negative space for the complete heading.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Complete Phrase Rule",
        "body": "Responsive wrapping must preserve words and spaces. A hidden hard line break must not join adjacent words.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Content Rule",
        "body": "Keep service containers flat; reserve elevation for the floating consent panel and navigation.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep the navy and cool-light contrast, with blue used for meaningful emphasis.",
      "**Do** use self-hosted Manrope and preserve the complete heading at every breakpoint.",
      "**Do** keep content containers inset within full-width tonal sections.",
      "**Do** use inline SVG for technical icons and retain visible illustration disclosures.",
      "**Do** preserve keyboard focus, meaningful control heights and reduced-motion behaviour."
    ],
    "donts": [
